The root cause is now concrete: the sandbox’s PID namespace exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through the latter. I’m using a narrowly scoped local preload shim that redirects only that exact procfs lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not touch any audit input or alter the generated project.
