+
+## Stage 4 obligations and target identity
+
+My independent domain set is empty. This exactly matches:
+
+- `input-manifest.json.source_rules = []`;
+- `obligation-map.json.source_rules = []`;
+- `obligation-map.json.obligations = []`;
